  "behavior": "Individual native pack.mcmeta follows the upstream SERVER data range. Forge ResourcePackLoader uses DelegatingPackResources with new current-client PackMetadataSection for hidden client packs; NeoForge ResourcePackLoader similarly synthesizes current-client metadata for hidden defaults. RenderScope does not opt into showAsResourcePack. No client resource format is replaced by a data format in the synthetic client pack.",
  "legacyFields": "No pack_format or supported_formats: these actual data ranges are beyond the legacy boundary, and the CLIENT codec forbids supported_formats above64.",
  "codecRegressionSuite": "dev.renderscope.modern.NativeResourcePackMetadataTest",
  "codecRegressionCases": [
    "emittedNativeMetadataIsAcceptedByBothActualPackTypeCodecs",
    "resourceRangeAlonePassesClientButFailsTheNativeServerPackRead"
  ],
